    {
      "id": "wfq84o6",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "9.3 Saka (Jauhar) Events"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Saka is the heroic last stand by Rajput warriors (death in battle). Jauhar is the mass self-immolation by Rajput women to avoid capture by enemies.",
      "id": "qpuo0oc"
    },
